# Important

Before generating CSS,

Cursor must inspect the entire project to detect:

- Existing typography system
- Font family
- Colors
- Border radius
- Spacing scale
- Tailwind tokens (if present)
- CSS variables already used
- Design System

The generated CSS must match the project's design language.

Never invent a different design system.

--------------------------------------------------------

# Final Goal

Produce the most complete Rich Text stylesheet possible for CKEditor-generated HTML.

No HTML tag that CKEditor can generate should remain unstyled.

The final stylesheet should be production-ready, reusable, responsive, accessible, and safe to use across all CMS pages without affecting the rest of the application.